WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.921
VectorMapNet has three stages.

00:00:02.001 --> 00:00:08.656
A bird's-eye-view extractor maps each modality into
a shared space: cameras through a ResNet and IPM,

00:00:08.736 --> 00:00:12.057
LiDAR through PointPillars, fused by concatenation.

00:00:12.137 --> 00:00:17.325
A detection transformer with element queries
locates each element as keypoints.

00:00:17.405 --> 00:00:21.659
An autoregressive polyline generator then emits
ordered vertices,

00:00:21.739 --> 00:00:24.660
trained with detection and generation losses.
